    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sojourn Past is a fast-paced, bullet-hell inspired action-adventure game. Dash, slash, and teleport your way through challenging enemies and difficult bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world where a story of loss and healing unfolds through discovery, visual storytelling and emotional soundtracks. Your journey isn\u2019t just about survival, but a search for healing and endurance.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFICULT ENEMIES AND BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/a262ecc6f21cdd0b65ed24b819069720.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/a262ecc6f21cdd0b65ed24b819069720.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/a262ecc6f21cdd0b65ed24b819069720.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, skill-based combat against challenging enemies and difficult bosses that will test your reflexes and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BULLET-HELL INSPIRED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2c922d650adc163b66e7ab9729910c05.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2c922d650adc163b66e7ab9729910c05.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2c922d650adc163b66e7ab9729910c05.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, dodge, and fight your way through intense bullet-hell challenges that test your reflexes and precision at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/13694006ea8eff9aa22dcc6727d8e358.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/13694006ea8eff9aa22dcc6727d8e358.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/13694006ea8eff9aa22dcc6727d8e358.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master abilities like the teleportation dagger to break through enemy lines, escape danger, or reach places hidden from plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDDEN SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2597295b0e1a102ea27e3c163bc36afd.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2597295b0e1a102ea27e3c163bc36afd.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2597295b0e1a102ea27e3c163bc36afd.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden pathways and uncover secrets tucked away in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > INTERACT WITH THE WORLD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/d3b472cf377cb4f684c9be296d6c6852.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/d3b472cf377cb4f684c9be296d6c6852.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/d3b472cf377cb4f684c9be296d6c6852.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture through the world, discover and interact with your surroundings to reveal what lies beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sojourn Past is a fast-paced, bullet-hell inspired action-adventure game. Dash, slash, and teleport your way through challenging enemies and difficult bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a mysterious world where a story of loss and healing unfolds through discovery, visual storytelling and emotional soundtracks. Your journey isn\u2019t just about survival, but a search for healing and endurance.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFICULT ENEMIES AND BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/a262ecc6f21cdd0b65ed24b819069720.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/a262ecc6f21cdd0b65ed24b819069720.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/a262ecc6f21cdd0b65ed24b819069720.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, skill-based combat against challenging enemies and difficult bosses that will test your reflexes and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BULLET-HELL INSPIRED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2c922d650adc163b66e7ab9729910c05.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2c922d650adc163b66e7ab9729910c05.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2c922d650adc163b66e7ab9729910c05.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, dodge, and fight your way through intense bullet-hell challenges that test your reflexes and precision at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/13694006ea8eff9aa22dcc6727d8e358.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/13694006ea8eff9aa22dcc6727d8e358.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/13694006ea8eff9aa22dcc6727d8e358.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master abilities like the teleportation dagger to break through enemy lines, escape danger, or reach places hidden from plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HIDDEN SECRETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2597295b0e1a102ea27e3c163bc36afd.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2597295b0e1a102ea27e3c163bc36afd.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/2597295b0e1a102ea27e3c163bc36afd.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden pathways and uncover secrets tucked away in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > INTERACT WITH THE WORLD</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/d3b472cf377cb4f684c9be296d6c6852.poster.avif?t=1755149506\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/d3b472cf377cb4f684c9be296d6c6852.webm?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876290/extras/d3b472cf377cb4f684c9be296d6c6852.mp4?t=1755149506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture through the world, discover and interact with your surroundings to reveal what lies beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
